OL,3,AWhy Australia chose the world's biggest
OL,4,Apolitical stage to reveal OpenAI hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe breach happened in June, but OpenAI
OL,7,Fsays it only became aware of it in
OL,8,FAugust - and then took until 10
OL,9,FSeptember to alert Australia's
OL,10,Fgovernment, by sending an email to an
OL,11,Faddress used by researchers and
OL,12,Facademics to alert authorities to
OL,13,Fconcerns of vulnerabilities.
OL,15,FWhile worrying, the timing of the
OL,16,Fincident is somewhat of a gift for
OL,17,FAustralia.
